{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a church at the end of your street- but there shouldn't be.\u00a0You saw it when walking home from the bus stop after work. You grew up on this street. You have walked down this road daily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is not a church at the end of the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this text-based horror game, you play as someone haunted by a church. It infects your day, and will do anything to get you to come inside. Will you be able to resist it? Or will the church swallow you whole?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Drawn Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Church\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative -\u00a0 Your choices change how you interact with the church</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings - Some good, some bad, some ????</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789180?t=1760987688","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789180/4e65a7aab01ce4bce952531080c188a9723e7c50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760987688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789180/ac40f062e98a1139f2407432383bf5fa8fa58ec3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760987688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789180/ac40f062e98a1139f2407432383bf5fa8fa58ec3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760987688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save An